BMad Method — https://github.com/bmad-code-org/BMAD-METHOD
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Adapted (rewritten for the herd flow, not copied verbatim) from the agent personas and workflows of
the BMad Method, as read at commit 61e01f82644c4bb533750cfa0d6d61ab61d2cc9b (2026-10-18):

  templates/herd/rules/ORCHESTRATOR.md  role-file structure; backlog principles of the Product Owner
                                        persona (requirements written once with their source, scope
                                        decided once, done as a check the owner runs, replan);
                                        orchestrator duties of the autonomous development loop
  templates/herd/rules/HERD-CUT.md      readiness standard, PASS / CONCERNS / FAIL readiness gate,
                                        set and dependency checks, the Architect's focus on
                                        invariants between independently built units
  templates/herd/rules/WORKER.md        Developer persona principles (the ticket is the spec, no task
                                        complete without passing tests, red-green-refactor, comments
                                        explain why); run-result report and blocking conditions of
                                        the autonomous build workflow
  templates/herd/rules/REVIEWER.md      review lenses (adversarial, edge case, verification gap);
                                        code-review triage (verify the claim before grading it,
                                        severity as the harm of one occurrence, no judging by
                                        similarity, zero findings is valid)
  templates/herd/rules/FIXER.md         finding routing (patch / decision needed / defer)
  templates/herd/task.md.example        numbered Given / When / Then acceptance criteria, boundaries
                                        ("Must not change"), marked note lines

